C; Plan IR igem-fluorescein-calibration compiled for Tecan FluentControl Load Worklist
C; Each A;/D; sequence is terminated by W; (FluentControl: F or W, not B)
C; WellPos uses alphanumeric form (A1, B1, …). Column-major 96-well: A1=1, B1=2, H1=8, A2=9
C; LiquidClass default: Water Free Single; TipMask is an 8-channel bitmask (ch0=1, all eight=255)
C; MIX steps are expanded to aspirate/dispense/W cycles
